  <item>
    <title>Vol.003 每个女孩毕业后都会把自己重新养一遍｜对话成长型女孩昕昕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685b81c02a38b4d9796d8c0a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685b81c02a38b4d9796d8c0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Jun 2025 06:10:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是断更好几年的播客第三期，未来我会持续采访更多女孩子，希望更多人可以因为我们这个栏目变得自信</span></p><span></span><p><span>非得非常厉害才能被称为大女主吗，我觉得不是，普通的女孩子身上都有闪光点，只要你觉得自己成长了，我就会为你每一个微小的进步鼓掌</span></p><span></span><p><span>几个观点想分享，快速成长的秘诀：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.打破世俗评价体系</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.接受各种各样的人存在，并且认为他们和自己没有太大的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.认可自己每一个微小的进步，就能换来更大的成果</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对我的内容感兴趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎链接 didixpy123456</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后，本期播客时间轴如下：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">3:56</a> 本期嘉宾介绍——昕昕，一个成长型大女主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">3:56</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="922">15:22</a> 对话昕昕：复盘是我两年内快速成长的底层逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a>对话昕昕：毕业后，我选择把自己重新养一遍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">26:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2156">35:56</a>对话昕昕：保持高能量的秘诀是顺应人性，专注过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2167">36:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a>对话迪迪：用力过猛是走向peace的必经之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2874">47:54</a>对话迪迪：给小朋友们的三条成长建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2879">47:59</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3368">56:08</a>对话迪迪：进入职场至今做过最正确的决策是寻找人生支点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3372">56:12</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3825">1:03:45</a>对话迪迪：过程vs结果，究竟谁更重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3837">1:03:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3959">1:05:59</a>昕昕的五年规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3959">1:05:59</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4044">1:07:24</a>播客结尾</span></p>]]></description>
